# Commit the curated memory; ignore the logs + transient runtime state.
#
# logs/ never goes to git. The event log is the full record but it grows without
# bound (tool-call payloads dominate it) and a real project's runs to tens of
# megabytes — past what GitHub will take. `.coauthor/state.md` + litdb notes are
# the committed record.
logs/
